# Deconstructing the NASDAQ: Two-Stage STL + SVAR

This repository implements the research workflow from your outline:

1. Stage 1 (microstructure filtering): robust STL on daily `NASDAQCOM`, then end-of-month sampling of the deseasonalized series.
2. Stage 2 (macro-structural dynamics): recursive (Cholesky) SVAR on monthly variables ordered as `INDPRO -> CPIAUCNS -> FEDFUNDS -> NASDAQ_SA`.
3. Inference outputs: orthogonalized IRF (with Monte Carlo confidence bands) and FEVD for NASDAQ response to policy shocks.

